OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill be mostly cloudy and largely dry
OL,7,Fwith just a few spots of light rain
OL,8,Fpossible. Dry overnight with clear
OL,9,Fspells developing. Rather cold.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA mostly dry day with bright
OL,12,For sunny spells. The odd isolated
OL,13,Fshower possible in the west.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,16,Fand breezy with heavy rain clearing to
OL,17,Fthe north later on Friday. Further
OL,18,Fspells of heavy rain over the weekend
OL,19,Fwith winds strengthening and bringing
OL,20,Fa risk of gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
